    # pc "Is something wrong?"
    pc "C’è qualcosa che non va?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:8
translate italian workdressbetter_922562fc:

    # bs "You know that you work in a professional environment, right?"
    bs "Lo sai che lavori in un ambiente professionale, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:9
translate italian workdressbetter_9917bac8:

    # bs "Don't you have anything nicer to wear than this outfit?"
    bs "Non hai niente di più carino da metterti invece di questo completo?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:10
translate italian workdressbetter_a6b99445:

    # bs "You look like a fanny-pack wearing vacation dad."
    bs "Sembri un papà in vacanza con il marsupio."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:11
translate italian workdressbetter_f1daf0fc:

    # pc "Oh, um... I like these clothes."
    pc "Oh, ehm… Mi piacciono questi vestiti."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:12
translate italian workdressbetter_630696d3:

    # bs "Well I don't. You need to start dressing better at work. Immediately."
    bs "Beh, a me no. Devi iniziare a vestirti meglio al lavoro. Subito."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:13
translate italian workdressbetter_4af2b761:

    # pc "Okay. I guess I can do that."
    pc "Va bene. Immagino di poterlo fare."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:15
translate italian workdressbetter_e5ecd3ed:

    # bs "Just like a nice polo and some slacks are fine. A suit if you're feeling fancy. No jeans, no shorts."
    bs "Basta una bella polo e un paio di pantaloni eleganti. Un completo se ti senti in vena di eleganza. Niente jeans, niente pantaloncini."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:16
translate italian workdressbetter_571316f2:

    # bs "Got it?"
    bs "Capito?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:17
